    ],
    "text": "Declaration under Section 5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      415.02,
      295.2,
      468.18
    ],
    "text": "I,Wijesundara Mudiyanselage Thilakaratna Bandara Ekanayake,Acting Minister of Lands, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) ofSection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described belowis needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      482.58,
      295.22,
      549.06
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land in total extent of about 2.8605 Hectaresdepicted in Advance Tracing No. R/ELP/2013/863 dated 12.08.2014,prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the Village ofDambuluwana (FVP 40) of Nawadun Korale, Palle Paththuwa MinorDivision in Divisional Secretary's Division of Elapatha in RatnapuraDistrict, in Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.17,
      361.74,
      545.8,
      425.7
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Dambuluwana Estate \u2013 Extent : About 2.8605HectaresNorth: Road and Velamitimulla Estate; East: Velamitimulla Estateand Dambuluwana Estate; South: Dambuluwana Estate and Road(Pradeshiya Saba); West: Road (Pradeshiya Saba) and DambuluwanaEstate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
